Z||000003||fiero56||10-29-1999||09:04 AM||||That is the way kits are supposed to be done.  I've seen some on the roads and the internet, that just don't look like much thinking went into them.  This looks well thought out, thre car has an overall good appearance, not just one or two sections.  Plus the real kicker, all the body panels look like they lign up perfectly!  No sagging, no big gaps, everything aligned.  I bet that one costs quite a few bucks.  I think it's one of the best I've seen. There were a few in Columbus a few months ago that looked this good, maybe better.||||reg||7
