Z||000019||Monkeyman||11-20-1999||05:22 AM||||PISA sells the Scorpion kit along with a few others.  I like the XTC/gt.  They also have a very nice custom dash ($$$$).  Before you buy a kit, you might want to check with your insurance agent.  Your rates will skyrocket!  Since it won't be a "stock" car, you can't just replace a single part in the event of a minor accident.  Might have to buy the entire kit.  I'll bet your insurance co. won't be too happy paying $6000 for a fender!||||reg||1
